@startuml agentic-system-boundary
title Agentic System Boundary ; per ADR-ES-025 + CR-ES-025

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "System" as Sys
class "Agentic System" as ASys
class "Agent" as Ag
class "Intent" as Int
class "Authority" as Auth
class "Policy" as Pol
class "Constraint" as Con
class "Context" as Ctx
class "Action" as Act
class "Outcome" as Out
class "Agentic Workflow" as AWf
class "Capability" as Cap
class "Service" as Svc

Sys <|-- ASys : specializes

ASys --> Ag : engages
ASys --> Int : interprets
ASys --> Auth : operates-within
ASys --> Pol : governed-by
ASys --> Con : constrained-by
ASys --> Ctx : responds-to + adapts-to
ASys --> Act : selects + coordinates
ASys --> Out : produces
ASys --> AWf : uses
ASys --> Cap : supports
ASys --> Svc : implements

note right of ASys
  Per ADR-ES-025 section 11:
  Agentic System is NOT Agent
  Agentic System is NOT Agentic Workflow
  Agentic System is NOT Agentic Operations
  Agentic System is NOT Agentic Service
  Agentic System is NOT Agentic Organization
  Agentic System is NOT Agentic Enterprise
  Agentic System is NOT Autonomous System (deferred)
  Agentic System is NOT AI System merely because it uses AI
  Agentic System is NOT Automated System merely because it automates
end note

@enduml
